{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "用配方法解方程 x²+4x+3=0",
    "goals": [
      "掌握配方法的三个核心步骤：移常数项、两边加一次项系数一半的平方、开平方求解",
      "理解为什么必须在等式两边同时加 4，以及如何利用完全平方公式配方"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "遵循学生偏好，先给结论与最终解，再层层剖析每一步的依据",
        "运用豆豆老师轻快鼓励的风格，结合拼图比喻解释为什么常数项必须补 4",
        "使用有序步骤图与板书公式严格对齐每一步变形依据"
      ]
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过三步标准配方法完整求解 x²+4x+3=0，并逐一说明每一步变形成立的数学原理",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们先直接看结论：方程 x²+4x+3=0 的两个解是 x₁ = -1，x₂ = -3！接下来我们用配方法一步一步把它解出来，并弄清每一步为什么成立。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "用配方法解方程 x²+4x+3=0",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x^2 + 4x + 3 = 0 \\implies x_1 = -1,\\; x_2 = -3"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "第一步，移常数项。把左边的 +3 移到等号右边变成 -3，得到 x²+4x = -3。依据是等式性质：等式两边同时减去 3，等式依然成立。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "diagram",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "过程图",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "as": "step-01",
                    "label": "移项：两边减3"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-02",
                    "label": "配方：两边加(4/2)²=4"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-03",
                    "label": "开方求解：x+2=±1"
                  }
                ],
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "as": "edge-01",
                    "from": "step-01",
                    "to": "step-02",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "edge-02",
                    "from": "step-02",
                    "to": "step-03",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x^2 + 4x = -3"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦第一步移项过程",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "第二步，也是最关键的配方！观察左边 x²+4x，一次项系数是 4，一半是 2，2 的平方是 4。为了凑成完全平方式 (x+2)²，我们在等式两边同时加上 4！左边变成 (x+2)²，右边 -3+4 刚好是 1。等式两边加同一个数，依然完全相等！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x^2 + 4x + 2^2 = -3 + 4 \\implies (x+2)^2 = 1"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "配方法秘诀",
                "items": [
                  "1. 移项：让左边只留含x的项",
                  "2. 配方：两边同时加 (b/2)²",
                  "3. 化简：左边写成 (x+m)²，直接开方"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "第三步，两边直接开平方。因为某个数的平方等于 1，所以这个数必须是 ±1，也就是 x+2 = ±1。分开算：x+2 = 1 得到 x = -1；x+2 = -1 得到 x = -3。每一步都有扎实的代数根据，整洁又清晰！",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x + 2 = \\pm 1 \\implies x = -2 \\pm 1 \\implies x_1 = -1,\\; x_2 = -3"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-02"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "配方法的核心是：把常数项移到右边，两边同时加上一次项系数一半的平方，凑成完全平方式后直接开方求解。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
